  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 202cb6532a4a7f80682b508098ca96f0, type: 3}
  m_Name: item_art_a5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GlorifiedBody.Interaction.ItemDefinition
  itemId: art_a5
  displayName: THE GEAR
  kind: 6
  drugType: 0
  colour: {r: 0.95, g: 0.55, b: 0.2, a: 1}
  description: Her own voice, about the thing in front of her. She does not know
    how she knows it.
  logText: 
  readFlag: 
  mapFloor: 
  audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  tapeLines:
  - at: 0.4
    speaker: LUCY
    text: It's on every panel, the same gear, and the oldest geared machine we have
      came out of a shipwreck off Antikythera, which is a Greek island,
    skipIfFlag: 
  - at: 7.6
    speaker: LUCY
    text: sponge divers brought it up in 1901.
    skipIfFlag: 
  - at: 10.78
    speaker: LUCY
    text: I'm sure of the year and I don't know why I'm sure.
    skipIfFlag: art_gear_first
  - at: 14.785
    speaker: LUCY
    text: About two thousand years old.
    skipIfFlag: 
  - at: 17.58
    speaker: LUCY
    text: A wooden box of bronze gearwheels, around thirty of them left,
    skipIfFlag: 
  - at: 22.19
    speaker: LUCY
    text: and the wheels tracked the sun and the moon and told you when the next
      eclipse was coming.
    skipIfFlag: 
  - at: 28.34
    speaker: LUCY
    text: Nothing that fine turns up again for more than a thousand years.
    skipIfFlag: 
  - at: 33.06
    speaker: LUCY
    text: Somebody built it, and somebody put it on a ship.
    skipIfFlag: 
  - at: 36.955
    speaker: LUCY
    text: Nobody knows who made it, or for whom.
    skipIfFlag: 
